.TH SCENEOP 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
SceneOp \- The kind of queued scene\-stack change
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef enum { OP_PUSH, OP_POP, OP_REPLACE } SceneOp;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The kind of queued scene\-stack change. Games never build one directly; engine_push(), engine_pop() and engine_replace() do.
.SH VALUES
.TP
.B OP_PUSH
add a scene on top
.TP
.B OP_POP
remove the top scene
.TP
.B OP_REPLACE
pop the top scene, then push another
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR PendingOp (3),
.BR engine_push (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
